## Symbol System

Use these prefixes to reference project elements:

| Symbol | Name | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| `#` | Component | Any documented code unit (function, class, module, service) |
| `$` | Flow | Multi-step processes with defined sequence |
| `^` | Gate | Authorization/validation checkpoints |
| `!` | Signal | Events emitted for side effects |
| `~` | Aspect | Rules/constraints with required code anchors |

See `.paradigm/specs/symbols.md` for complete reference.
